# MkDocs with the Material theme, which builds the documentation website of every
# repository from its mkdocs.yml and docs/: the Docs workflow, and the Dashboard
# workflow for the blueprint's own. Every repository gets the hash-pinned
# requirements-docs.txt as .github/docs-requirements.txt, and Renovate keeps both
# current here. The plugins are those of .github/mkdocs-blueprint.yml:
# - mkdocs-material[imaging]: the preview card of every page for social media
# - mkdocs-glightbox: images that open enlarged
# - mkdocs-git-revision-date-localized-plugin: the date of the last change of a page
# - mkdocs-static-i18n: a website in more than one language, with a switch
mkdocs-material[imaging]
mkdocs-glightbox
mkdocs-git-revision-date-localized-plugin
mkdocs-static-i18n
